{"unit_id":"AIcivilization__dsh-vps-manager#card-zh","repo":"AIcivilization/dsh-vps-manager","commit":"00d77a49b4fcda988e28a489a5ab42e0a4fa78c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vps-manager 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的 VPS 运维插件：在对话中绑定已登记服务器，通过 SSH 执行 AI 工具和免模型命令，并提供设置页、状态与文件面板及真实终端。它支持读取主机清单、运行远端脚本、带备份写文件、跟踪长任务、使用可重复运行的运维菜谱，以及按会话切换 VPS 模式。适合需要从 DSH 管理 Linux 服务器、检查服务或维护配置的用户；需要本机 Node.js 与 SSH 客户端，以及可登录的远端 VPS，不需要插件专用 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:80-130","lib/index.js:239-263","lib/tools.js:79-105","lib/commands.js:115-175"]}
{"unit_id":"AIcivilization__dsh-vps-manager#card-en","repo":"AIcivilization/dsh-vps-manager","commit":"00d77a49b4fcda988e28a489a5ab42e0a4fa78c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vps-manager lets DSH users manage VPS hosts over SSH. It adds AI tools, model-free commands, status and file panels, and a terminal. Users can inspect hosts, run scripts, edit files, track tasks, and reuse recipes. It requires Node.js, an SSH client, and a VPS.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:80-130","lib/index.js:239-263","lib/tools.js:79-105"]}
